OL,3,GNEWSACash machine torn from town's high
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cash machine has been torn from a
OL,7,Ffuneral directors' building on an Essex
OL,8,Fhigh street, causing significant
OL,9,Fdamage.
OL,11,FIt happened in Halstead at about 01:50
OL,12,FBST, said police.
OL,14,FAt the scene, officers found one
OL,15,Fvehicle that had been used in the
OL,16,Fincident that was still running.
OL,18,FNo arrests have been made, but the
OL,19,Fforce said officers had spoken to
OL,20,Fseveral witnesses and urged anyone with
OL,21,Finformation to come forward.
